ASSET LICENSING:

All bundled graphical assets (textures, skyboxes, planetary maps) are sourced
from public-domain repositories:

- NASA imagery: Public Domain (U.S. Government Work)
- ESA imagery: Public Domain or ESA/Hubble Creative Commons (verified per asset)
- JWST imagery: Public Domain (NASA/ESA/CSA)

See assets/ATTRIBUTION.md for detailed source information and licensing for
each asset.

Users adding custom assets must comply with the sourcing requirements outlined
in assets/ATTRIBUTION.md and must only use public-domain or permissive-licensed
materials from approved sources (NASA, ESA, Hubble, JWST, etc.).

IMPORTANT: This software license (MIT) applies to the code only. Assets have
separate licenses as documented in assets/ATTRIBUTION.md.
